assages, climb walls, and float through the air—use newly acquired movement abilities to open previously inaccessible paths and uncover hidden secrets and rewards even in areas you’ve already explored.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/99b1cc655aeeaca1fc3ac0be1470e796.poster.avif?t=1793241649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/99b1cc655aeeaca1fc3ac0be1470e796.webm?t=1793241649\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/99b1cc655aeeaca1fc3ac0be1470e796.mp4?t=1793241649\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an underworld filled with ancient castles, mysterious natural environments, dangerous modern facilities, and hidden ruins, each with its own atmosphere and challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/21a7adf575258fdb00a928b28c95c4c5.poster.avif?t=1793241649\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/21a7adf575258fdb00a928b28c95c4c5.webm?t=1793241649\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/21a7adf575258fdb00a928b28c95c4c5.mp4?t=1793241649\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerful Bosses and Massive Threats<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful bosses, each with their own unique attack patterns and abilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From tense chase sequences against massive enemies to intense one-on-one battles, a variety of challenges await Kisha.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/bfe91eaaa1ececec6db351288b1f1d2a.poster.avif?t=1793241649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/bfe91eaaa1ececec6db351288b1f1d2a.webm?t=1793241649\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/bfe91eaaa1ececec6db351288b1f1d2a.mp4?t=1793241649\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn your enemies’ attacks and use your newly acquired abilities and skills to overcome each threat in your own way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Secrets of a Reawakened Ancient Kingdom<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet survivors who continue to hold on to hope even in this desperate underworld, and rescue those in danger.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the traces left behind throughout the underworld to uncover the secrets surrounding Kisha and the truth behind the corruption.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/fc6809a08e570cea8ca1c4d87e22be40.poster.avif?t=1793241649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/fc6809a08e570cea8ca1c4d87e22be40.webm?t=1793241649\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/fc6809a08e570cea8ca1c4d87e22be40.mp4?t=1793241649\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also customize Kisha’s appearance with a variety of costumes as you continue your adventure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/93c6f9bf863a4dd79561cb3ee2203320.poster.avif?t=1793241649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/93c6f9bf863a4dd79561cb3ee2203320.webm?t=1793241649\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/extras\/93c6f9bf863a4dd79561cb3ee2203320.mp4?t=1793241649\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Join Kisha, a cat revived with the help of his ancestors, to absorb the powers of infected enemies and blink through attacks in an instant. Discover hidden recipes, fuse absorbed skills into new attacks, and explore a mysterious underworld in this 2D action Metroidvania.","supported_languages":"English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil","reviews":"“There’s a ton of heart and depth to be found here”<br>8.5\/10 – GameTyrant<br><br>“Fatal Claw builds on familiar ideas to deliver a solid, visually stunning Metroidvania packed with content.”<br>8\/10 – GameBlast<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/d7d0e546e2ed7a1cd07f3abfdc2b65f140201b24\/header.jpg?t=1793241649","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2827750\/51e25c8198055dda1e23f3df4deb6b80cc38ca2d\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793241649","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/